---
// src/components/Includes.astro - Sección «Qué incluye» (id="que-incluye") en dos columnas limpias sin cajas
---

<section id="que-incluye" class="includes-section" aria-labelledby="includes-title">
  <div class="container includes-container">
    <header class="includes-header" data-reveal="editorial">
      <div class="eyebrow-wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="eyebrow-text">QUÉ INCLUYE</span>
      </div>
      <h2 id="includes-title" class="includes-title">
        Qué recibes con DECA Light.
      </h2>
    </header>

    <div class="includes-grid">
      <div class="includes-col" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="1">
        <h3 class="includes-col-title">Lo que hace</h3>
        <ul class="includes-list">
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-check" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>Importación del informe de tu ERP y de cartas de porte en PDF, varias a la vez</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-check" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>Cargas agrupadas por transportista y estados claros: Lista para emitir, Falta matrícula, Revisión</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-check" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>Matrícula de tractora y remolque una vez por camión</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-check" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>Emisión de todos los DeCA de un transportista con un botón</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-check" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>DeCA en PDF con QR, y envío al transportista por correo</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-check" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>Modificar, sustituir y anular, con motivo e historial</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-check" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>Equipo: cada persona con su usuario</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-check" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>Datos en la UE, con copias de seguridad cifradas diarias</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="includes-col" data-reveal="card" data-reveal-delay="2">
        <h3 class="includes-col-title">Lo que no tienes que hacer</h3>
        <ul class="includes-list">
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-skip" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            </svg>
            <span>cambiar de ERP</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-skip" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            </svg>
            <span>instalar nada (funciona en el navegador)</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-skip" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            </svg>
            <span>teclear la matrícula en cada albarán</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-skip" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            </svg>
            <span>rellenar un formulario por DeCA</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-skip" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            </svg>
            <span>registrar a los conductores en ninguna plataforma</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .includes-section {
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
    background-color: var(--color-bg-canvas, var(--palette-slate-50));
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
    scroll-margin-top: 5rem;
  }

  .includes-header {
    margin-bottom: 2.75rem;
  }

  .eyebrow-wrap {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.625rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.875rem;
  }

  .eyebrow-line {
    width: 1.5rem;
    height: 2px;
    background-color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    border-radius: 9999px;
  }

  .eyebrow-text {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
  }

  .includes-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.875rem, 3.2vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    margin: 0;
  }

  .includes-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .includes-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 7fr 5fr;
      gap: 4rem;
    }
  }

  .includes-col-title {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary, var(--palette-slate-900));
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    padding-bottom: 0.875rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-border-strong, var(--palette-slate-300));
  }

  .includes-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .includes-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.875rem;
    padding-block: 0.9375rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle, var(--palette-slate-200));
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary, var(--palette-slate-600));
  }

  .icon-check {
    color: var(--color-brand-primary, var(--palette-emerald-700));
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .icon-skip {
    color: var(--color-text-muted, var(--palette-slate-500));
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .includes-section {
      padding-top: 3.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
